: "语气助词“了（1）”位于句子末尾或句中停顿的地方，表示有变化或出现新情", "confidence": 0.99828, "box": [[0.16225, 0.74734], [0.84458, 0.74796], [0.84458, 0.76489], [0.16225, 0.76426]]}, {"text": "况。否定回答时，用副词“没”，句子末尾不用“了”。", "confidence": 0.99593, "box": [[0.12383, 0.77053], [0.58753, 0.77116], [0.58753, 0.78809], [0.12383, 0.78746]]}, {"text": "The modal particle “了 (1)\" is placed at the end of a sentence or at a pause within a", "confidence": 0.96949, "box": [[0.1614, 0.7931], [0.84629, 0.79436], [0.84629, 0.81254], [0.1614, 0.81129]]}, {"text": "sentence to indicate a change or a new situation.For negative responses,the adverb“没”is", "confidence": 0.96841, "box": [[0.12383, 0.81755], [0.84543, 0.81755], [0.84543, 0.83386], [0.12383, 0.83386]]}, {"text": "used, and \"了\"”is omitted at the end of the sentence.", "confidence": 0.92402, "box": [[0.12297, 0.83887], [0.51836, 0.8395], [0.51836, 0.85643], [0.12297, 0.8558]]}, {"text": "1大声朗读。Readaloud.", "confidence": 0.99014, "box": [[0.13834, 0.86771], [0.3339, 0.86771], [0.3339, 0.88401], [0.13834, 0.88401]]}, {"text": "（1）下雨了。", "confidence": 0.9992, "box": [[0.15628, 0.89028], [0.28608, 0.89216], [0.28608, 0.9116], [0.15628, 0.90972]]}, {"text": "（2）十二点了，吃午饭吧。", "confidence": 0.999, "box": [[0.43723, 0.89091], [0.69855, 0.89279], [0.69855, 0.9116], [0.43723, 0.90972]]}, {"text": "（3）A：弟弟起床了吗？", "confidence": 0.99578, "box": [[0.15884, 0.91724], [0.38856, 0.91724], [0.38856, 0.93417], [0.15884, 0.93417]]}, {"text": "B：没起床呢。", "confidence": 0.99137, "box": [[0.42869, 0.91536], [0.57045, 0.91724], [0.5696, 0.93542], [0.42784, 0.93417]]}, {"text": "088", "confidence": 0.99886, "box": [[0.0333, 0.94734], [0.08198, 0.94734], [0.08198, 0.96865], [0.0333, 0.96865]]}]}